    passageHtml: `In 1943, in the midst of World War II, mathematics professor Grace Hopper was recruited by the US military to help the war effort by solving complex equations. Hopper&rsquo;s subsequent career would involve more than just ________ as a pioneering computer programmer, Hopper would help usher in the digital age.`,
